    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Medical Students of Aga Khan University participated in and won the 1st round of the All Pakistan Inter-University Quaid-e-Azam Quiz Competition being organized by Pakistan Television to celebrate \"The Year of Quaid-e-Azam\". The teams that participated were Aga Khan University, the Hamdard University and Mehran University of Engineering & Technology, Jamshoro. The students on the AKU team were Ali Kazmi (Class of 2004), Mahboob Alam (Class of 2002) and Muslim Atiq (Class of 2002).",
